<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.8 bln bond due 2000 yields 5.572 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.8 bln bond due 2000 yields 5.572 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.8 billion auction of 5.5 percent bonds due February 1, 2000 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     5.572	99.777  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     5.558	99.818  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    5.587	99.732   0.97222</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on October 15. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$2.8 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$6,619.25 million, including C$69.75 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
